{"ref":"BDB, דַּד","hw":"דַּד","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">דַּד</span>]</big>  <strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.19\">Pr 5:19</a></sup> <strong>breast</strong>, better <strong>teat, nipple (</strong>τιτθοί Aq <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.19\">Pr 5:19</a> Symm <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.3\">Ez 23:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.21\">21</a>; NH & Aramaic <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּד</span>; primit. caressing word; according to Fl in NHWB<sup>i. 439</sup><strong>)</strong>—Du cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּדֵּי</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.3\">Ez 23:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.8\">8</a> (both del. 𝔊 𝔖 Co); sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּדַּיִךְ</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.21\">Ez 23:21</a> (read <span dir=\"rtl\">בתוליך</span> 𝔖 Co); <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּדֶּיהָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.19\">Pr 5:19</a>;—of breasts of woman <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 5:19\" href=\"/Proverbs.5.19\">Pr 5:19</a> (Hi Bi read <span dir=\"rtl\">דֹּדֶיהָ</span> <em>her love</em> cf. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 7:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.7.18\">7:18</a>); of Samaria & Jerusalem under fig. of young women <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.3\">Ez 23:3</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(דַּדֵּי בְּתוּלֵיהֶן)</span> cf. v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:8\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.8\">8</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">דַּדַּיִךְ</span> v <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:21\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.21\">21</a>; but prob. del. <span dir=\"rtl\">ד׳</span> in Ez cf. supr. & Gei<sup>Urschrift 397</sup>.—Vid. also <a data-ref=\"BDB, שַׁד²\" href=\"/BDB,_שַׁד²\", dir=\"rtl\">שַׁד</a> sub <a data-ref=\"BDB, שַׁד²\" href=\"/BDB,_שַׁד²\", dir=\"rtl\">שׁדה</a>.","next":"BDB, דֹּד","prev":"BDB, דָּגַר"}